window.products.push({"id":863013,"name":"Hot Air Popcorn Popper, 1200W Popcorn Machine for Home Use, No Oil Needed Popcorn Maker, Healthy Air Popcorn maker (White)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71nhIf80RcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Specification: Color: White Power: 1200W Weight: 2.6LB/ 1.2 kg Plug Type: US Plug Voltage: 110VFrequency: 60Hz Material: Metal, Plastic, Stainless Steel Product Size: 6.3 x 7.1 x 11.8 inch Features: Stay-Cool Housing: With silkscreen logo On/Off Switch: Easy one-touch operation Popping Chute: Removable for dishwasher cleanup Butter Warming/Measureing Cup: 1/ x 4-cup capacity (about 60g) Package Content: 1 x Popcorn Maker, 1 x User Instruction Manual Tips: ➤ Please avoid touching the heated surface when the Popcorn is working, the temperature of interior surface will be very high. ➤ This popper will not shut off automatically, to prevent burning, when the machine does not pop out of popcorn for 5 to 8 seconds，turn the switch “off”. ➤ This Hot Air Popcorn Maker can burst about 50-60 grams corn for one time. So the capacity is limited. And it is recommended to use no more than 5 minutes each time. ➤ Since the capacity of the item is limited, if you need more popcorn, pls continue to popcorn 2 times. With high temperature protection design, don't worry about quality problems. This popcorn maker can continue to work after cooling, wait for 15 to 30 minutes before using it again. ➤ Premium popcorn has larger kernels, resulting in a higher yield of popped corn. If using premium popcorn, the yield may sometimes be greater than stated above. ➤ This is a home hot air popcorn machine, it can not directly add butter and sugar, after the flavor Popcorn has been, you can add condensed milk，butter or caramel. ➤ If there is a few kernals left after working, that will be normal. Please pour it out, then use it for the next time. Don't worry about that.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71nhIf80RcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Homdox","source_asin":"B082NPX9G2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-863013","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B082NPX9G2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B082NPX9G2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
