window.products.push({"id":863145,"name":"Circleware Ceramic Double Chafer Buffet Food Server Warmer Tray with Handles Glass Lid & Chrome Metal Serving Stand, 1 Quart Each, 16\" w x 9.75\" D x 5","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71HPlq6L4sL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"▶ Circleware was formed with the sole mission of providing classic, contemporary glass pieces of the highest quality. ▶ Circleware Manufactures All types of Glass Serveware, Drinkware, Barware, From Glass Beverage/Drink dispensers with stand, Water Dispensers, Drinking glasses, coffee cups, wine glasses, glass tupperware, glass jars, glass containers, Shot glasses, Mason jars, Mason Mugs, Yorkshire Mason jar mugs, Mini Mugs with shaped ball mason jar glass lids or with metal lids, the famous Circleware Country Mini Mug Glass Shot Glasses With Glass handles And Wooden Tray, colored mason jars, glass lids, cups with lids and straws, glass jars, beverage cooler, food storage containers, tea infuser, coffee mug, drinking games sets, drink shaker/mixer, mason jars with handles, candy jars, Butter dishes, chalkboard glasses, Olive oil bottles, Wine decanters, water bottles, water drink carafes, whiskey glasses, Double beverage dispensers, milk bottles, beer glasses, oil and vinegar bottles, Moscow mule copper mugs, spigot, glass mugs, pitchers, fruit infuser, drinking cups, tea dispenser, pilsner drinking glasses, butter dish, dishes, glass sets, mason glass jar sets with lids, ice buckets, glass pitchers and many more.▶ Circleware is sold by all major nationwide retailers and is known to have the best selling glassware around the globe, They are the most trusted brand in glassware that delivers the highest quality glass at the best prices, style, and value to all segments of the North American market, both retail and commercial. We aim to be the primary resource of the world's most 'value-able' glassware reflective of centuries-old, hand-crafted, artistic European and Mediterranean styling while utilizing the most up-to-date technology from leading factories around the globe. Our collection is updated continuously so that we may bring our customers what we consider to be the finest collection of glassware available today★","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71HPlq6L4sL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Circleware","source_asin":"B00TUUTNMW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-863145","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00TUUTNMW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00TUUTNMW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":863146,"name":"nuLOOM Rigo Hand Woven Farmhouse Jute Area Rug, 6' Round, Off-white","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41NvmQxf50L._AC_.jpg","description":", The images we display have the most accurate colors possible.Rug Colors, sizes, patterns may vary slightly depending on how your rug is made and the size ordered.Due to different monitor resolutions and lighting you may notice a slight difference in color. Each handmade rug is unique to the artisan who weaved it.These are not considered defects Bunching, Creases and Folded Corners: You may see some creases and bunching in the pile and around the corners when you unroll your new rug. These waves will flatten within 2 -3 weeks as you begin to use your new rug. Use these tricks to help flatten your rug: Back Rolling: Roll the carpet out, then roll it back up reversely with the backside up. Let it sit rolled up reversely for a day or 2, or until it flattens out. Heavy Objects: Lay a piece of heavy furniture or objects on affected areas for a day or 2, or until it flattens out. If the corners are sticking up, curl them back and place heavy objects on affected areas going the opposite way. Heat: Use this technique as a last resort only. Place the rug over a cleared concrete or area like a driveway or sidewalk setting during dry sunny conditions. Allow the rug to be positioned for optimal sunlight as long as possible to give the rug time to absorb the sun's heat for up to 2 hours, but use more time if needed. Blow Dryer: If a large concrete patch with optimal sunlight is not accessible, flip the rug over and use a hair dryer to affected areas to heat up the creases. Always hold the hair dryer 7 to 12 inches away from the rug going side to side on a medium setting, as heat can sometimes cause backing to melt.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41NvmQxf50L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"nuLOOM","source_asin":"B00XNK9E7Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-863146","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00XNK9E7Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00XNK9E7Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":863147,"name":"Goneby Reusable Silicone Air Fryer Liners 2 Pack with Air Fryer Magnetic Cheat Sheet, Easy Clean Air Fryer Accessories, Non Stick, AirFryer Accessory ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710560KsToS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our Reusable Air Fryer Liners Reusable Air Fryer Liners are nice and practical kitchen tools that can be applied to making chips, roast chicken, and so on, and they are good kitchen helpers to give your wife, mom, friends, neighbors, or those who have air fryer pots. SAFE & HEALTHY 100% Premium, Food-Grade Silicone Perforated Design For Maximum Air Flow Flexible Liners Fit Round Baskets Heat Resistant Up to 430 F Degrees Phthalate, PFOA and BPA Free! WHY KIPPLE The Air Fryer Mats saves money on single-use parchment paper or a replacement air fryer basket when the coating beings to chip or wear. Easy to clean-Gently Rinse with water, suitable washing with hands or Clean it in the dishwasher, Made with soft Silicone material. NOTE: kindly choose a size according to your basket size allow the little tolerance of measuring.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710560KsToS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Goneby","source_asin":"B09FGTQ1YL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-863147","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09FGTQ1YL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09FGTQ1YL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":863148,"name":"cozymomdeco Korean Made Silver Color Cutlery Spoon Chopsticks 18-10 Stainless Steel Printed Traditional Pattern_2 SET","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81XH-RErnsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【PRODUCT】2SPOONS + 2CHOPSTICKS 【QUALITY KOREAN MADE】Our spoon and chopsticks are quality made in Korea. It made of top food grade 18/10 stainless steel, providing durability will last you many years. Their edges have been polished many times and are smooth that they won't scratch your mouth. They are resistant to rust, corrosion and dishwasher safe. It's a great alternative to the plastic spoons. 【DURABLE GRADE OF STAINLESS STEEL】18-10 Stainless steel is considered as the most durable grade. It will not easily bent and fade off. Each of our stainless steel is Non-toxic, no metal aftertaste, BPA free and made to last the test of time to provide you with years of use. 【MODERN & TRADITIONAL IMPRESSION】 囍 is symbolized meaning \"Felicitous\". The symbol indicates wishing for a number of felicitous moments in your life. Our spoon and chopsticks are carefully designed modern simplicity based on Korean traditional style. It has a traditional Korean based simple design allows for mix and match with your existing flatware to elevate everyday meals into a fine dining experience. 【DISHWASH FREE】Our stainless steel product is dishwasher safe. Before use it first time, stainless steel spoon and chopsticks require washing with mild detergent and soft scrubber several time, but only the first time. 18-10 grade stainless steel is top graded material. It is more durable and weight. The silver color will not fade.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81XH-RErnsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"cozymomdeco","source_asin":"B09Z28NSL8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-863148","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09Z28NSL8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09Z28NSL8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
