window.products.push({"id":863150,"name":"Fitted Sheet Clips for Bedding, Keeping Sheets Firmly In Place - Stable, Adjustable Triangle Design Elastic Nylon with Rust Proof Nickel Plated Clamps","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.79,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91yEKMvOymS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ENJOY A COMFORTABLE SLEEPING EXPERIENCE. We offer a simple way to ensure that sheets stay in place and you can avoid an uncomfortable sleep. Despite bed movement, twists, and turns while sleeping, these bed sheet clips keep sheets in place and will protect your mattress sheets from wrinkles, bunching, and popping off. STABLE AND ADJUSTABLE HOLDING. These sheet holder straps are durable elastic straps that have a three clamp triangle design. The nickel plated clamps are rust proof and durable. Each clip sheet has an adjustable, high-quality band with a lock system. It allows appropriate tension to clasps the corners of the sheet tightly. Our package is a set of four bed bands for sheets with black or white color variation. QUICK AND EASY INSTALLATION TO KEEP SHEETS FIRMLY IN PLACE. No more hassle of arranging the bed and readjusting the sheets when your kids, pets, and rough sleepers pop off the sheets while playing or sleeping. Having these mattress clips for sheets is a time-saver as you don't have to keep on fixing the sheets every time it slides off from all corners. Our straps for bed sheets are easy to remove and put back on. DURABLE HOLDING, BUT SHEETS WILL NOT BE DAMAGED. The wide elastic of the mattress sheet clips allows you to adjust the tension and secure the triangle design even if the sheet is short for the bed. The sheet stays intact, safe, and secured even if you take them on and off when it's time to replace the beddings. WORKS WITH ALL TYPES OF BEDDINGS AND OTHER APPLICATIONS. Our sheet garters are suitable for all types of beddings like fitted sheets, mattress pads, and flat sheets. These bed sheet grippers can also keep the fabric tight even on hospital beds, cushions, table cloth covers, vehicle covers, ironing board covers, and grill covers. If you have an adjustable bed, you may need corner straps for the sheets so they won’t pop off or slide every time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91yEKMvOymS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"One & Able","source_asin":"B096BPXFJS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-863150","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B096BPXFJS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B096BPXFJS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":863151,"name":"BLACK+DECKER S300 ScumBuster Cordless Wet Scrubber","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/3171QH9FR7L._AC_.jpg","description":"Product description Product Name: Black & Decker S300 Scum Buster Cordless Wet Scrubber Product ID: 028877315119 Product ID Type: upc Category (item-type): household-carpet-and-upholstery-cleaning-equipment Amazon.com Does cleaning the tile in your kitchen or bathroom feel like an aerobic workout? This lightweight, cordless ScumBuster by Black & Decker is sure to make cleaning your bathroom or kitchen much easier. With a nonslip, comfortable grip and four attachments (a 4-inch scrub pad for wide area cleaning, a 3-inch area brush for tub and tile cleaning, a detail brush for corners and around faucets, and a 4-inch mild pad for light scrubbing), the ScumBuster is great for a wide variety of jobs. And with 3.6 volts of power, there's no need for elbow grease. --Jane DePaolo","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/3171QH9FR7L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BLACK+DECKER","source_asin":"B00004SBGQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-863151","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00004SBGQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00004SBGQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
