window.products.push({"id":863215,"name":"【Wide Mouth】Canning Lids, 100-Count Mason Jar Lids for Ball, Kerr Jars, Split-Type Metal Rustproof & Leakproof，Food Grade Material Canning Jar Lids,10","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81L8Ndl02uL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Great Value Set】: 100 Pcs Great value canning lids set！You will receive 100 Pcs wide mason lids in silver color and 48 labels stickers, enough quantity to share with your family or friends, it can help you seal canned foods and fresh for a long time. 48 free label stickers can help you record the names of food ingredients for easy classification. Best of all, 100% compatible fit with all wide mouth glass preserving jars including Ball and Kerr mason jars! 【Thickened Upgrade】: No one likes rust-prone easy-deformed mason jar lids. Our canning jar lids are made of thickened tinplate, approx 3.38 inches/ 8.6cm in diameter, inner rings are made of food-grade with BPA-Free silicone, make the lids more solid high-temperature resistant corrosion resistance, and rust resistance, making canned food is safer and more assured. 【Excellent Sealing】: The sealing ring made of food-grade eco-friendly silicone inside the jar lid makes the mason canning jar lids with good sealing performance, airtight and leak-free, each jar sealing ring features small grooves design for a tight and secure fit, not easy to slip or move around, tightly seal ensures it's suitable for keeping food, grains, dressings, drinks fresh, no need to worry about leakage that may contaminate the kitchen or other places after sealing food. 【Convenient & Multipurpose】: The top of canning jar lids is designed with a DIY record area to record the date or name of the food, you can make jams, drinks, pickles with confidence, and share these delicacies with your family anytime without forgetting and losing them. You can even let your imagination run wild and make these lids into unique family or Christmas crafts, ideal for gifts! 【100% Satisfaction】: LITTLE JOY provides you with 100% satisfactory shopping experience. If receive a defective product or have any questions with our wide canning lids, please feel free to contact us and we will reply to you within 24 hours. We have confidence that you will like us. If you are not satisfied, please contact us in time. We will replace or refund you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81L8Ndl02uL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LITTLE JOY","source_asin":"B099NFJJ8X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-863215","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B099NFJJ8X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B099NFJJ8X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
