window.products.push({"id":863290,"name":"VASYITSO LED Curtain String Lights, 300 LED 8 Lighting Modes 9.8×9.8 Feet USB with Remote, Waterproof Fairy String Lights for Christmas Bedroom Party ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61eIHy+BX0L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"【Wonderful Decoration】This LED Curtain Lights has 300 LED lights, it can cover an area of almost 10x10 feet. It will bring brightness to your party, and create a festival and a romantic atmosphere. It's a rare decor for party, birthday, festival and so on, it also perfect for indoor and outdoor use, bedroom, curtain, dormitory, and garden, patio, balcony, or wherever decoration lighting is needed. 【8 Lighting Modes Settings】This LED Curtain Lights have 8 modes for you to choose, Combination, Inwaves, Sequential, Slo Glo, Chasing/Flash, Slow Fade, Twinkle/Flash, Steady on. Just use the buttons on the remote control to adjust the 8 mode settings. Set the lighting mood as you like and want, make your event and night glamorous. 【Remote Control with Timer】The handheld remote control makes it easy for you to turn on/off the lights, change the mode, and adjust the brightness; to avoid forgetting to turn off the lights, you can set a timer to blink the lights for 6 hours and 18 hours a day to turn off. Everything is under your control! 【Easy Installation】This LED Curtain Lights no assembly required, the top of each rope is equipped with a hook. Before untie the rope, hang the lights so that they will not be entangled. Do not remove the tie before hanging it, so as not to cause unnecessary confusion. 【Waterproof & Safety】The wire parts of the string lights are fully sealed, even in rain and water spill, it still works normally. Powered by USB, suitable for phone chargers, computers, television, USB power bank and other devices, secure low voltage lighting and remain cool to touch, no need to worry about overheating, making it safe for your family and children.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61eIHy+BX0L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VASYITSO","source_asin":"B09CL49SVQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-863290","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09CL49SVQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09CL49SVQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
