window.products.push({"id":863508,"name":"F&B Angel Memorial Gifts for Loss of Loved One - Angel Candle Holder Bereavement Gifts for Loss of Mother with Flameless LED Candle - Loss of Husband ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71D-kd23myL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Personal Angel for a Loved One - Our angel figurines can act as a remembrance gift reminder that your loved one is being watched over in heaven. Whether a memorial gift for loss of mother, father, son, daughter, and any other friend or family your angel statue will honor them Share Sympathy for Any Loss - Grieving gifts go a long way in showing support to someone in pain no matter who they lost. Our angel gift can be a memorial gift for loss of husband or wife, sympathy gift for loss of mother or father, memorial gift for loss of son or daughter, gift for loss of a brother or sister Powerful Poem and Flickering Tealight - This memory gift for loss loved ones has every sympathy angel include a memorial poem to comfort loved ones in times of hardship and grief. Each remembrance angel also has a flameless LED loving memory candle that flickers to remind us that your loved one is still watching over us from heaven Safe and Secure Packaging - Our loss of a mother sympathy gifts are carefully secured by hand to ensure every angel comes perfectly intact. When providing support to those in pain we believe taking every step to ensuring every package brings comfort to those grieving F&B GUARANTEE - At F&B we stand by our products and offer a no questions asked warranty if you experience any issues with your F&B product. To recieve a full refund simply contact F&B directly through the Amazon messaging system. We will be happy to assist you with any questions, issues or difficulties you encounter 100% customer satisfaction is what we strive for at F&B","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71D-kd23myL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FEATHER & BLOSSOM","source_asin":"B08Z3C9JF2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-863508","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08Z3C9JF2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08Z3C9JF2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":863509,"name":"Gifts & Decor Zhang Fei Defender of Liu Bei Red Cliff Figurine Romance of The Three Kingdoms","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":65.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71y4X40SvYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Zhang Fei (died 221),[1][2] courtesy name Yide, was a military general who served under the warlord Liu Bei in the late Eastern Han dynasty and early Three Kingdoms period. Zhang Fei and Guan Yu, who were among the earliest to join Liu Bei, shared a brotherly relationship with their lord and accompanied him on most of his early exploits. Zhang Fei fought in various battles for Liu Bei, including the Red Cliffs campaign (208–209), Liu Bei's takeover of Yi Province (212–215), and the Hanzhong Campaign (218–219). He was assassinated by his subordinates in 221 after serving for only a few months in the state of Shu Han, which was founded by Liu Bei earlier that year.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71y4X40SvYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gifts & Decors","source_asin":"B0147IHCCO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-863509","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0147IHCCO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0147IHCCO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":863510,"name":"Gourmia GCU9265 Egg Slicer & Wedger Features Stainless Steel Blades","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QYmrO87cL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Perfectly uniform slices for an egg-cellent presentation! Add a chef’s flair to every home-prepared meal with the Egg Slicer by Gourmia. This 2-in-1 gadget makes it easy to slice, dice, and wedge your hard-boiled eggs with comfort and accuracy. From a healthy chef salad to soups, appetizers, and other gourmet creations, you’ll never bother with tedious food prep knife work again. In fact, the unit requires no elaborate accessories or replacement parts. The built-in lid handle houses top-of-the-line stainless metal wires that pierce your eggs with pinpoint precision. It’s a gadget that requires only one hand, but the results are restaurant ready! Multipurpose Egg Wedger If you love entertaining guests for breakfast, lunch, and dinner, the Egg Slicer helps you easily impress them! Slice up flawless helpings of hard boiled egg for toast, salads, ramen bowls, sandwiches, and more. Easy Manual Operation There’s no need for a mandoline or food processor. This specially designed cutter lets you dice and shred eggs with one simple motion. Just lift the topper, place the protein on your desired chamber, and slice downward. 2 Separate Cutting Areas Chop up more than one egg at a time on the device’s ample dual-chamber platform. One area features wire blades for making 6 identical wedges, while the other side thinly portions the egg crosswise. Rustproof Stainless Steel The slicing handle houses two sets of heavy duty steel wires that won’t rust, bend, or dull over time. This home kitchen essential never needs replacement blades, so it offers both the value and peace of mind you expect from Gourmia. Drop it in the Dishwasher Using a cutting board and knife takes time and trouble. Instead, this shredder is made of BPA-free ABS plastic and is completely dishwasher safe. Since it’s small in size, it also hand washes quickly in the sink.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QYmrO87cL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gourmia","source_asin":"B07MP94LS9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-863510","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07MP94LS9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07MP94LS9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
