window.products.push({"id":863612,"name":"Black Abalone Shell Mosaic Flower Pattern Rounded Square Bowl Dish - Handmade by Bali Artisans - 5-1/2\" x 5-1/2\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61pVXKlOI2L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"DESIGNER STYLING - This elegant Balinese tray sure to impress. This square jewelry dish features a slightly curved bowl design with abalone shells laid out in a design that looks like the petals of a blooming flower. Choose from either black or white abalone shells. The black tray features blues, silver and gray colors while the white takes on a lighter look with white, tan, and brown. This handcrafted piece will add unique flair to your home decor. It also makes a great gift! A STYLISH TOUCH – Meticulously hand-carved and handcrafted premium materials are the focus of every unique decorative item by Sarda Lifestyle. All of our creations are made with love by expert artisans in Bali, Indonesia. These tasteful housewares were designed by Janyl Adair with both form and function in mind. They harmonize perfectly with any decor, adding an updated, organic flair to your space. Choose these eye-catching items to add a unique look to your home or office. THE HIGHEST STANDARDS – Each gorgeous, collector-quality piece in our Amazon collection has been fashioned by a team of Balinese craftspeople with decades of dedication to Sarda’s brand. When you open the box and hold your new treasure, you’ll be impressed by the quality feel. Sarda designs are substantial, made with high-quality materials like striking shells and sturdy, sustainable wood. The beautiful detail and fine workmanship are as impressive up close as from a distance. AN IMPRESSIVE GIFT – Looking for a birthday or Mother’s Day gift idea for your mom, daughter, sister, granddaughter, or best friend? Sarda jewelry is on-trend and sure to delight. Packaged in a signature presentation box, it’s ready for giving – the perfect surprise for your wife or girlfriend for an anniversary or Valentine’s Day. Or treat yourself with our exotic designs and be dressed to impress for a girl’s night out, party, date, holiday celebration, wedding, or any special event. YOUR DELIGHT 100% GUARANTEED – At Sarda, our prime purpose is to provide the utmost customer service. To keep this standard, Sarda inspects each and every one of our products to make sure you are getting the very best! If for any reason you aren’t totally delighted, we’re pleased to offer a No-Questions-Asked Money-Back Guarantee for 90 days after purchase. We stand behind our products; if you ever encounter a problem with a Sarda piece, please reach out to us and let us know!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61pVXKlOI2L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SARDA","source_asin":"B09J91DSM2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-863612","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09J91DSM2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09J91DSM2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
