window.products.push({"id":863616,"name":"Culiri(TM) Pizza Wheel. Compact Strong Lightweight Zinc Alloy Pizza Cutter. 2.5 Inch Blade. For Homemade Pizza, Pies, and Pastries.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7194d9mgUYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Enjoy the Perfect Pizza So… You know that you are a good cook! You work hard, come home, and decide to treat your family to a delicious dinner of home-made pizza. /p> As your sizzling hot pizza pie emerges from the oven, you take out your kitchen knife to slice it, you realize that you need the right pizza cutter to enjoy the perfect pizza. The Culiri Compact Strong Lightweight Pizza Wheel is made especially for home made cooks like you. At only 3.2 ounces – it is easily managed by anyone! You do not have to be a big burly “Pizza Man” to make easy slices. You no longer need one of those clumsy, heavy and bulky heavy professional grade pizza wheels to slice your small pie. Besides for straining your muscles while slicing, they will clutter up your preciously-needed drawer space! Premium quality for a sturdy structure, so it doesn’t break, fall apart, or get rusty.  The 2.5 inch metal wheel has a tapered edge, sharp enough to make a smooth, precise cut through pizzas, torts, and quiches, yet dainty enough to cut precise slices.  Ergonomic design prevents excessive pressure on the wrist while providing a firm, anti-slip grip, along with a thumb guard for added safety.  Its compact and sturdy structure allow it to take up little room and it can slide right back into your cutlery drawer without clutter!  Low maintenance – The wheel is dishwasher safe or you can clean it by hand in warm soapy water.  At 3.2 oz, it's the lightest pizza wheel on the market! Culiri has the perfect tool for the home-made cook. That’s why it stands for Culinary Excellence","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7194d9mgUYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Culiri(TM)","source_asin":"B0184NW5ZM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-863616","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0184NW5ZM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0184NW5ZM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
