window.products.push({"id":863662,"name":"Edomi Flight Pillow for Neck Support Memory Foam Travel Neck Pillow U Shaped Pillow for Car Airplane Travel Accessories for Nap on Flight, Green","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/611XySAP0YS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":">>>We are very grateful that you have chosen EDOMI in many stores, Thanks for your trust. About US: EDOMI founded in 2012, We are a global online retail shop and reliable wholesale company, and specialize product in the three core categories of Home & Kitchen, Sports & Outdoors, Tools & Home Improvement. All products sold based on their excellent designs and reliable quality! We are committed to design, manufacture and market comfy pillows filled with memory foam pillow cushion core. They are superior to other fills and give the proper support and comfort you desire.  1.Memory foam pillow is highly malleable and breathable, which makes them ideal pillow fill. 2.We want you to be comfortable at home, work or on the go. Hulls have properties that make them uniquely comfortable, supportive and therapeutic for a restful nights sleep. 3.We strongly believes in and sustainable products. Many of our products are filled with memory foam pillow cushion core. Although these fillings have been around for centuries in all around the world.  4.By targeting pressure points in the right places to give you great comfort and support. By placing this under your neck, it helps to promote the proper sleeping posture. That makes it easier on your back and neck, helping to reduce the discomfort of a poor sleeping position. Package List: 1 x Pillow Care Instruction: Remove the Inner memory foam pillow cushion core, WASH the PILLOW CASE, and AIR DRY THE Inner memory foam pillow cushion core, Do not wash filling! Note: 1.Due to saturation levels on different monitors, the color of the actual product may vary slightly. 2.Handmade there might be a 0.3-0.5 inch size difference, hope you kindly understand. Thank you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/611XySAP0YS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Edomi","source_asin":"B0876B36KN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-863662","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0876B36KN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0876B36KN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":863663,"name":"Safavieh Handmade Soho Miyase Modern Burst New Zealand Wool Rug Rust/Multi 2'6\" x 10' Runner Graphic 10' Runner Runner, Indoor Living Room, Bedroom,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":124.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/814QlsPPlWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Soho Collection is Safavieh?s response to market demand for clean, transitional design in rugs that work equally well in traditional and contemporary homes. The collection?s unique purity and clarity of the color is achieved by selecting only the purest premium New Zealand wool as a canvas for Safavieh?s exciting new color palette. Many of the designs in the Soho collection are accented with viscose for silky softness to outline patterns, and further highlight the softness of the wool. This innovative collection is hand-tufted in India.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/814QlsPPlWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Safavieh","source_asin":"B00C1BTWVY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-863663","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00C1BTWVY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00C1BTWVY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
