window.products.push({"id":863744,"name":"TeQsli Full Mattress 10 Inch, Cool Eggshell Memory Foam and 7 Zone Pocket Innerspring Hybrid Mattress in a Box, Pressure Relief & Supportive Full Size","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":229.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91eV1XjbhSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🟤 【Cooling & Breathable Effect】- TeQsli spring mattress is made of high-end comfort knit fabric and eggshell convoluted foam. The convoluted foam can evenly disperse your body pressure, promote air flow and regulate your sleeping temperature, making your sleeping environment cool and cosy. After work, sleeping on the foam mattress will absolutely help soothe your nerves. 🟤 【Motion Isolation & Edge Support】- The full mattress features an individual pocket coils spring system that does well in motion insolation. When people or pets sleeping next to you move, you can still enjoy an undisturbed sleep. Reinforced edge support makes sure that sleepers will not slip off. Besides, it has a longer average lifespan than other traditional innerspring mattresses. 🟤 【Pressure & Pain Relief】- Our hybrid spring mattress is moderately firm. Conforming to body curves, it is good at targeting and relieving stress and can provide comfortable support for your neck, back and buttocks. A massage given by the convoluted foam will ease your tense muscles as well as your stress, so that you will wake up energetic in the fresh morning without pain or ache. Sound sleep makes good health. 🟤 【Mattress in a Box】- Our memory foam mattresses are professionally compressed, boxed, and delivered to your door. They're a good choice for mattress shoppers who want to easily have the mattress set up and get convenient delivery. Moreover, the mattress in a box fits all frames such as box springs, flooring, slatted bases, flat platforms. 🟤 【Risk-Free Return & Warranty】- We provide a 100-night trial and a 10-year limited warranty for every TeQsli mattress. Please place the mattress in a ventilated room for up to 72 hours to dissipate the slight odor and wait for it to fully expand. This will ensure you a better sleeping experience. If there are any problems, please contact us promptly.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91eV1XjbhSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TeQsli","source_asin":"B0C84BX7SY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-863744","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C84BX7SY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C84BX7SY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
