window.products.push({"id":863817,"name":"Oil Sprayer for Cooking, Olive Oil Sprayer Transparent Food-grade Glass Oil Spray Portable Spray Bottle Vinegar Bottle with Cleaning Brush for BBQ, Co","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51BicnI7CfL._AC_.jpg","description":"Specifications Item name: Olive Oil Sprayer Material: Stainless Steel with Glass Color: Silver Product size: 4cm/1.57inch *18cm/7.09inch (W*H) Product weight: 0.21kg/ 7.54oz Volume: 100ml/ 3.4oz High Quality Unlike other Olive Oil Bottles and Oil Sprayers, Our B-hero Oil Sprayer for Cooking are BPA free made from glass with stainless steel! Oil Sprayer is perfect for spraying ingredients instead of using a brushes when roasting, sauteing, baking, cooking Compact Anti-skid Design Our Oil Sprayer never clogs and leaks! The Oil Dispenser is handy and won’t slide away with the anti-skid design. Say goodbye to dripping bottles or spills. Simple To Use For the Oil Sprayer first time just a few clicks upon the pump and begin to cook. The pumping mechanism on the vinegar and Oil Sprayer is easy to use, auce vinegar olive and canola oil Sprayer. Multi-purpose Use Add your favorite Oil to the Sprayer, press the control button to produce a fine mist ( The higher you get, the better of mist ). Package Include 1 x BBQ Oil Sprayer 1 x Cleaning Brush Warm Tips 1. We suggest you clean Oil Sprayer before filling something. 2. When you use Oil Sprayer, please try to pump the sprayer for more times until it is works well. 3. The better usage is tilt bottle and press. 4. Maybe there is some residual on head after using, please prepare tissue or cleaning cloth to wipe. 5. Please don't put solid stuff in it to avoid Sprayer nozzle blocked. Important Notice As the density of the oil is different from the water, so the oil's performance may not so good as the water when it is sprayed. We suggest put the Sprayer higher a little when you use Oil, then you'll get the better of mist. Thanks for kind regards!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51BicnI7CfL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"B-hero","source_asin":"B07DNFHYDH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-863817","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07DNFHYDH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07DNFHYDH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
