window.products.push({"id":863874,"name":"Wine Champagne Bucket with 2 Ice Scoops - 4 Quart Stainless Steel Mirror Finish - 4 Ounce Bar Ice Scoop, Stainless Steel - Premium Restaurant, Dining ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41YuTt0FtoL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"It is very essential that the cold temperature of the wine or champagne is maintained. But, when it has to be delivered to your customers room in a hotel or bar from a refrigerator, the coldness might take a beating when customers do not drink it immediately or when they are having a nice time relaxing with friends. In those scenarios, a wine/ champagne bucket will come to great use. All you need to do is fill the bucket with ice around the wine bottle in it and that’s it. Wine will never lose its coldness.This wine bucket is made of a stainless steel material that makes sure that it will be very durable and corrosion resistant. The exterior of the bucket is very glossy making giving it an elegant look that your customers will be pleased to get their champagnes served in this. The sides of the wine bucket have two ring-shaped handles that are very sturdy and will aid in easy transportation of this bucket with wine with safety. This 7 1/2\" wine/champagne bucket with 4 quarts capacity will make sure that your bottle can be surrounded with ice for maintaining its temperature in an optimum level. This product from ChefGiant also comes with 2 ice scoops each having a capacity of 4 ounces. These scoops are also made of stainless steel and are so elegant in design making this a convenient and fast way of serving ice cubes to the customers.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41YuTt0FtoL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ChefGiant","source_asin":"B01NBXW9NN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-863874","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01NBXW9NN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01NBXW9NN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
