window.products.push({"id":863924,"name":"ZARPAX Car Dehumidifier Bag 4 pack | Absorbs Moisture, Damp, & Condensation on Windscreens & Car Interior | 100% Leakproof | Reusable Dehumidifier | D","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91mQuXlouQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"CANCEL CONDENSATION: Escape the nuisance of clouded, unclear windows and excess moisture with ZARPAX's vehicle dehumidifier bags. The innovative ZARPAX Car Dehumidifier battles this problem valiantly, attracting excess moisture like a magnet, and effectively absorbing it. Our dehumidifier bags eliminates excess moisture, ensuring the comfort and safety of starting your daily commute with a clear windshield. Safeguard yourself and your valuables with our expert dehumidifier bags! 100% LEAK PROOF: For a completely moisture-free, damp-free and condensation-free vehicle or boat, select ZARPAX's humidity absorber. Our car dehumidifier contains silica that seamlessly eliminates condensation and moisture from the air creating and maintaining an incredibly fresh environment! The moisture absorber is 100% leak proof meaning you will never have to contend with leakage or stains, only a dry interior and gleaming windshields! DIRECTIONS OF USE An intelligent design, ZARPAX's dehumidifier bags are incredibly easy to use. Once placed in the desired vehicle or boat, the water-retaining dehumidifier fills with moisture present in the air. The humidity indicator will then slowly change from blue to pink. Once the indicator has changed colour, it has reached absorption capacity & must be put into the microwave (2x6 minutes). LONG LASTING FRESHNESS: ZARPAX's car dehumidifier is brilliantly reusable. It has been engineered to be as durable and long-lasting as possible. The bags are reset with both ease and speed to ensure a permanently unclouded and crystal-clear windscreen. There is no predetermined expiry date on our moisture absorbers and the reusable nature of the dehumidifier bags promises durability and a long life combating condensation. AMPLE CAPACITY: Our dehumidifier bags come in a set of 4. Our moisture absorbers for cars and other vehicles are a substantial size of 299g, equipped with a larger capacity for bigger vehicles and boats. The dehumidifier bag can be stored anywhere in the vehicle or boat, and if desired, can be easily concealed and will still operate effectively even if out of sight.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91mQuXlouQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Zarpax","source_asin":"B0B2SDN16V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-863924","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B2SDN16V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B2SDN16V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
