window.products.push({"id":863939,"name":"Wjiang Pour Over Coffe Maker, Coffee Dripper Brewer, Stainless Steel Paperless Reusable Filter, Clear Glass Drip Coffee Maker, Manual Coffee Pot, High","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61jgjBwxHkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Borosilicate glass coffee machine】- The pour over coffee maker is made of high borosilicate glass with excellent heat resistance. This material has high hardness and is stable and not easy to deteriorate. It can be used in extremely high or low temperature conditions. In addition, the coffee maker can also be heated on an electric ceramic heater, all your needs! 【Stainless steel filter】- Equipped with a double-layer filter made of 304 stainless steel. The double filter technology can greatly prevent coffee grounds from entering the cup, ensuring that you enjoy the most delicious coffee. A good substitute for disposable filters, no waste, and environmentally friendly. 【600ml Large Capacity】Our filter coffee maker with biggest capacity about 600ml, you can share the unique coffee with your family or friends, also suitable for home, office, restaurant and many other occasions. And there is a scale mark on the surface of the coffee pot which is clear and not easy to erase. 【Wooden Handle & V Shaped Outlet】This hand coffee maker equipped with a comfortable wooden handle which is anti-scalding, you can easily grip the cafe pot and not worry about burning the fingers. The spout is designed with a V shape, which makes the coffee easily to pour. 【Easy to clean】- The smooth glass liner is easy to clean, the stainless steel filter of the glass coffee dripper can be cleaned with a damp cloth, and the filtered residue can be removed by rinsing with water, which saves a lot of time and allows you to enjoy your coffee without any worries. It's better quality than plastic, ceramic or glass coffee filters and saves the hassle of buying paper coffee filters and is more affordable.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61jgjBwxHkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wjiang","source_asin":"B09DPF7WWY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-863939","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09DPF7WWY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09DPF7WWY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
